{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00700",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.34,
      "end_seconds": 13.91,
      "duration_seconds": 11.57,
      "text": "Morning. Er, I'd like a sexual health check, please. I've just ended a relationship and I want to be sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.7,
      "end_seconds": 24.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Of course, and it's completely routine. Is there anything that prompted it, any symptoms?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.05,
      "end_seconds": 37.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.96,
      "text": "Not really. A tiny bit of itching, down there, on and off, for about a fortnight. Nothing else."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.6,
      "end_seconds": 44.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Any discharge, sores, or pain when passing urine? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.76,
      "end_seconds": 50.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "No. Just the itch. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.23,
      "end_seconds": 58.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Anything else medically I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.75,
      "end_seconds": 67.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "I get eczema, mostly on my hands. That's all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.74,
      "end_seconds": 76.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Let me check your pulse and temperature first. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.08,
      "end_seconds": 80.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.62,
      "end_seconds": 95.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Pulse 68, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.68,
      "end_seconds": 100.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Fine? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.36,
      "end_seconds": 112.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Fine. I'll examine you if you're comfortable, and there's a chaperone available if you'd prefer one. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.04,
      "end_seconds": 142.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "No, it's fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.99,
      "end_seconds": 155.51,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "Thank you. I can't see any sores, rash, or warts, and nothing else of concern."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.37,
      "end_seconds": 161.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "That's a relief. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.76,
      "end_seconds": 176.19,
      "duration_seconds": 11.43,
      "text": "The itch may well be a minor irritation, but we'll check properly. What would you like to know about how this works? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.95,
      "end_seconds": 183.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Which tests do you do? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.25,
      "end_seconds": 198.66,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "I'd like to take swabs for chlamydia and gonorrhoea, and arrange a urine sample, and a blood test for HIV, syphilis and hepatitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.2,
      "end_seconds": 203.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "All of those? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.9,
      "end_seconds": 215.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "It's the standard full screen. The swabs take a minute, and the blood is a single sample. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.11,
      "end_seconds": 222.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Okay. When will I know? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.0,
      "end_seconds": 233.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "Results come back by text within a week, and if anything's positive, we'll phone you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.65,
      "end_seconds": 240.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "And if it's all clear? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.43,
      "end_seconds": 258.53,
      "duration_seconds": 14.1,
      "text": "You'll get a text saying so. And I'd like you to come back in two weeks, to make sure the itch has settled."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.52,
      "end_seconds": 264.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Two weeks. Fine. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.66,
      "end_seconds": 277.37,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "Use condoms with any new partner until you've had the results, and ideally for a while after."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.29,
      "end_seconds": 282.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "I will. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.66,
      "end_seconds": 289.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Anything else you'd like to ask, now you're here? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.26,
      "end_seconds": 299.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thanks for not making it awkward. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.81,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "It's what we're here for. ~"
    }
  ]
}
